BT /F2 11 Tf 56 770 Td (3. Options Analysis) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 56 742 Td (3.1 Option A: Managed image-based cloud backup service) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 728 Td (Option A is a business-tier managed backup service of the kind offered by several) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 714 Td (established vendors. A lightweight agent is installed on the file server and on the database) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 700 Td (host. The agent takes an initial full image of each machine and then uploads incremental) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 686 Td (changes on a schedule set by the administrator, which can be as frequent as every hour.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 672 Td (Backups are compressed and encrypted on the server using AES-256 before they leave the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 658 Td (office, and the encryption key can be held by the firm rather than the provider [4].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 634 Td (The service stores backups in a UK data centre and offers an immutable storage setting in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 620 Td (which backup copies cannot be deleted or changed for a defined period, even by an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 606 Td (administrator account. This directly addresses the ransomware requirement, because an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 592 Td (attacker who gains administrator access to the office network cannot destroy the recovery) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 578 Td (points. Retention policies can be configured to keep daily versions for 30 days, monthly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 564 Td (versions for a year and yearly versions for seven years, which exceeds the six-year) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 550 Td (retention expectation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 526 Td (Recovery can be performed in two ways. Individual files and folders can be restored through) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 512 Td (a web console within minutes, meeting the one-hour RTO for files. For a full server failure,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 498 Td (the image can be restored to replacement hardware or, as an interim measure, started as a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 484 Td (virtual machine in the provider's cloud so that staff can reconnect while the hardware is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 470 Td (repaired. The vendor documentation states that a 1.2 TB restore over the firm's 500 Mbps) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 456 Td (connection would take approximately six hours, which is within the eight-hour RTO [4]. For) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 442 Td (larger disasters the provider can ship a physical drive containing the backup.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 418 Td (Management is carried out through a web dashboard that shows the status of every protected) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 404 Td (machine and sends email alerts when a job fails. This suits a firm without in-house IT) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 390 Td (staff, since the external contractor can monitor the backups remotely and receive alerts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 376 Td (The provider also publishes an independent ISO 27001 certification, which gives some) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 362 Td (assurance about its security practices [5].) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 56 324 Td (3.2 Option B: Consumer cloud storage synchronisation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 310 Td (Option B, synchronising the file server to a consumer-grade cloud storage account, was) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 296 Td (briefly considered but is not suitable for a business of this kind and was not analysed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 282 Td (further.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 56 242 Td (4. Evaluation Against Criteria) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 228 Td (Security: Option A fully meets the security criterion. Client-side AES-256 encryption means) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 214 Td (data is protected before it leaves the office and while stored, and the firm controls the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 200 Td (encryption key. The immutable storage setting is the most important feature for this firm,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 186 Td (because it ensures that recent recovery points survive a ransomware attack. Multi-factor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 172 Td (authentication is available for the management console and should be enforced.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 148 Td (Recovery capability: Hourly incremental backups during office hours give an effective RPO of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 134 Td (one hour, well within the four-hour requirement. File-level restores through the console) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 120 Td (take minutes, and full image restores are estimated at six hours, meeting the RTO. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 106 Td (ability to boot a backup as a cloud virtual machine provides an additional fallback if) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 92 Td (replacement hardware is delayed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 68 Td (Compliance: Data is stored in the UK, which simplifies compliance with UK GDPR, and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 290 30 Td (Page 2 of 4) Tj ET
endstream
