BT /F1 10 Tf 56 786 Td (provider offers a data processing agreement as required when a third party processes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 772 Td (personal data [2]. Configurable long-term retention satisfies the six-year requirement. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 758 Td (firm should record the backup arrangement in its data protection documentation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 734 Td (Ease of management: The central dashboard, automated scheduling and email alerting mean that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 720 Td (the backup process no longer depends on a partner remembering to take a drive home. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 706 Td (external contractor can deploy the agents in less than a day, and routine monitoring should) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 692 Td (take only a few minutes per week.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 668 Td (Cost: Option A is priced per protected server plus a charge for storage. The costs are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 654 Td (summarised in Table 1. Over three years, including an allowance for data growth and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 640 Td (contractor's setup time, the total cost is approximately GBP 10,900. This compares favourably) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 626 Td (with the likely cost of a serious data loss, which for small firms can include regulatory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 612 Td (penalties, lost fees and reputational damage [3].) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 56 572 Td (5. Cost Comparison) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 558 Td (Table 1. Estimated costs \(excluding VAT\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 535 Td (Cost item   Option A: Managed cloud backup   Option B: Consumer cloud storage) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 522 Td (Licence per server per year   GBP 420 ◊ 2 = GBP 840   GBP 0) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 509 Td (Storage per year \(2 TB\)   GBP 2,280   GBP 192) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 496 Td (Contractor setup \(one-off\)   GBP 600   GBP 150) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 483 Td (Contractor monitoring per year   GBP 300   GBP 300) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 470 Td (Year 1 total   GBP 4,020   GBP 642) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 457 Td (Three-year total   GBP 10,860   GBP 1,626) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 443 Td (Although Option B appears much cheaper, the table does not reflect the cost of the functions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 429 Td (it lacks. The additional cost of Option A is justified by the reduction in risk to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 415 Td (firm's client data.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 56 375 Td (6. Recommendation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 361 Td (It is recommended that Hollins & Pryce adopt Option A, the managed image-based cloud backup) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 347 Td (service, with the following configuration: hourly incremental backups of the file server and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 333 Td (database host between 07:00 and 19:00; a nightly full synchronisation; immutable retention) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 319 Td (of at least 30 days; long-term retention of monthly and yearly copies for seven years;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 305 Td (client-side encryption with the key held by the firm; and multi-factor authentication for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 291 Td (all console accounts. The existing USB drive can be retained for one additional month as a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 277 Td (transitional local copy while the first full cloud backup completes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 253 Td (The firm should ask its external contractor to carry out the installation, configure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 239 Td (alerting to both the contractor and the office manager, and perform a full test restore to a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 225 Td (spare machine within the first month. Test restores of sample files should then be carried) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 211 Td (out each quarter, and a full restore test once a year, because a backup that has never been) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 197 Td (restored cannot be relied upon [1]. With this arrangement the firm will move from a weekly,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 183 Td (manually handled backup to an automated, encrypted and ransomware-resistant solution that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 169 Td (meets its recovery objectives and its obligations under data protection law.) Tj ET
